# tests/user/dbguidemo.ndb: dbg's window (tests/qemu/dbgui.ndb) on
# dbgdemo's program, built again as dbguidemo: its source bound at /src, as
# its debug information names it, and a window of its own.

service=dbguidemo program=/boot/bin/dbg console when=vx.desktop
arg=-x
arg=/boot/tests/dbguidemo.cmds
arg=/boot/bin/dbguidemo
mount=/ srv=bootfs
bind=/src new=/boot/src
mount=/proc srv=proc
mount=/tmp srv=tmpfs
mount=/wsys srv=wsys aname=self
connect=nsd
